      "mergeID": "63d00aea327d58529b4e0b4c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The search feature for groups is currently not very useful. You have to type the full name of a certain group (case-insensitive) in order to find it - if a group name consists of 4 words, but you only search for 1-3 of them, it will not show up in the results.\n\nIf I search for a certain word, I would expect to find every group which contains that word in its name.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Groups are hard to search for",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6388503c87ad14540382a2fa",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
