      "mergedPostDetails": "VRC Groups are nice, but i see a weakness in finding groups. That is because search is only working on titles.\n\nWhen i try search some known groups, it seems search is not working very well or not effective.\n\nGood example is find roleplaying groups. So i go search on \"roleplay\" and... nothing showed up, but i know roleplay communities exist.\n\nSearch for \"car\" or \"race\" also no result, if you want find group for race lovers.\n\nDrinking groups with \"drink\"? Very limited, i know there are more drinking groups.\n\nFilming groups with \"film\"? Also way too limited. Because filming community exists.\n\nIt means search on names or titles is not good enough.\n\nWorlds have tags, makes finding them more easier. So... add tags to groups will help a lot to find them much better. Because right now, find a group is still hard, i tried some words where i am sure there are groups, i can't find some group or still many ignored even i am sure there are groups.\n\nPlease add tags to groups, and we can discover much more groups.\n\nAnother help tip: add also below how many hidden private groups are found, but don't show names in the result. Just let me know there are some hidden groups. Then we can search around by some friends or discord for some groups.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add tags to find VRC Groups better",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6388503c87ad14540382a2fa",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
