      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please change the search query for the group search from equals to contains ('%<search string>%'). So you can also find a group by just typing a part of the name. \n\nThis would solve many problems. People already created multiple groups for the same purpose (e.g. fangroup of some avatar or creator) because they couldn't find an existing one.\n\n \n\nAs a side note: Some groups even got deleted by moderation for competing with existing groups, but no group member has heard of the other groups.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
