  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently a subset of characters, or just the text of the short code will not give results. \n\nIf I want to search by topic, either add tags, more search functions (search description etc) or make the search broader.  This will make topic groups more easily discoverable.\n\nExample: VRCPrefabs is the name, and PREFAB is the text of the short code, but \"prefabs\" or \"prefab\" does not return any results.",
